Package: openttd
Version: @DEB_OPENTTD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.openttd.org/
Depends: libsdl2-2.0-0, libcurl4, libpng16-16, liblzma5, libz1, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, libharfbuzz0b, libicu78
Description: OpenTTD transport simulation for Xios
 The complete open-source transport management simulation, built as a normal
 Xios Wayland desktop application with SDL2 video, PulseAudio sound, scalable
 fonts, international text shaping, networking, and downloadable content.
